From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LinearMC <linearmc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] LinearMC: net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/storage/RegionFileStorage.java

Ported from the Folia feature stack (minecraft-0011-Linear-flush-unlock.patch, minecraft-0009-Linear-region-format.patch, minecraft-0010-Linear-region-observability.patch, minecraft-0014-Linear-default-format.patch, minecraft-0018-Linear-core-decoupling.patch).
26.3 adapter of the 26.2 overlay: upstream reworked the cache to
Long2ObjectLinkedOpenHashMap<Optional<RegionFile>> (negative-result
handling without evicting live files), unified moonrise$getRegionFileIfExists
into getRegionFile(ChunkPos, boolean create), reworked write() around
getOrCreateRegionFile, and added the isChunkData/NbtAccounter/Files imports.
Linear + lines are carried over byte-identical except where that rework
forces adaptation (Optional<> wrapping/unwrapping, create-flag call sites,
dropped single-arg accessor); see the per-hunk disposition in the port notes.
Hand-resolved 3-way merge (Canvas base + Folia-new); see PORT-PLAN.md. Reconcile against Canvas base
patches touching this file before staging (see PORT-PLAN.md).
---
